#!/bin/bash
# Triple-Play Pipeline Environment
# Source with: source /home/allenai/scripts/.env
#
# ⚠️  API keys are NOT stored in this file for security.
#     Export them in your shell BEFORE sourcing, or pass them inline.
#
# Example:
#   export ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=***   export GEMINI_API_KEY=***   . /home/allenai/scripts/.env
#   python3 /home/allenai/scripts/triple_play_pipeline.py "Your task"

export OLLAMA_HOST="http://localhost:11434"
export OLLAMA_MODEL="phi3"
export TELEMETRY_URL="http://localhost:8094/api/telemetry"
export TOLL_FILE="/home/allenai/data/ai_toll_meter.txt"

# Safety check — warn if keys are missing
if [ -z "$ANTHROPIC_API_KEY" ]; then
  echo "⚠️  ANTHROPIC_API_KEY not set → Claude stage will be skipped"
fi
export GEMINI_API_KEY="***"
if [ -z "$GEMINI_API_KEY" ]; then
  echo "⚠️  GEMINI_API_KEY not set → Gemini stage will be skipped"
fi
